   "species": {
    "aiRules": [],
    "artDirection": "Hairless, no fur or tufts: a round-bodied, frog-like rot creature with a plump torso, a big round head and four short stubby legs with soft paw pads, and a short tapering tail. Its hide is glossy and tar-slick, streaked with thick dripping slime in the palette's accent colour. Clouded crystal is crusted into its hide in small irregular barnacle clusters, sitting flush, never standing up as spikes, posts or a row. Its eyes are always pale skyglass cyan with a bright pinpoint highlight, whatever the palette. Its signature: an enormous grin that splits its face nearly ear to ear, packed with jagged white teeth. Creepy-cute, mischievous, a little unsettling.",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-31T16:18:58.893Z",
    "defaultJutsuIds": [
     "GYy5K24tGkYIeGEJef3TW"
    ],
